# Main menu -> Single Player -> Play Random Map -> Start Game with the
# registry's options (tools/boot/seed_user.py: legion's, Small Continental,
# one computer player, Tournament, Deathmatch, Random Epoch), then the game
# itself for 90 seconds: the first frames of a game rendered natively. See
# settings.script for the pointer.
#
# The same game as legion's in-game reference (docs/reference/parity.md §3):
# 800x600x32, the map from seed 4242 (RECOMP_EE_FORCE_SEED, as legion's
# seed_force.js), legion's player name, frames at 5, 30, 60 and 90 s, the Capitol
# clicked at the view's centre at 68.8 s and the pointer parked at (745,188)
# after it. Random Epoch comes out Renaissance on both machines.
# tools/parity/compare.py compares the dumps with legion's.
# menus: alone (Start Game opens the game server: one at a time)
# menus: env RECOMP_EE_FORCE_SEED=4242
# menus: seed --width 800 --height 600 --player-name Unknown1634
timeout 400000
pointer f32 [0x9197a8]+4 [0x9197a8]+8
hold 250
wait frames 30
moveby 1 1
wait 300

click 511 268                 # Single Player
wait change within 15000
wait 1000
click 748 145                 # Play Random Map
wait change within 20000
wait 1500
dump game-setup

click 644 730                 # Start Game: black, the loading screen ("Creating
wait size 800 600 within 60000  # World...", "Loading Complete"), then the game
wait 1000
dump loading
# With custom civilizations off, EE sometimes opens "Choose Civilization"
# before the game (on the Mac in 2 of 3 runs, never in legion's; parity.md
# §3): its OK, with the first civilization highlighted, is here. When it did
# not open, the click lands on the map above the panel and does nothing.
wait 12000
click 400 520
# The game is up when its own command panel is (bottom of the screen; the
# loading screens have neither its colour nor its place). The panel's colour
# depends on the epoch (948a7b wood in the Prehistoric, 939d9c stone in the
# Renaissance); the loading screen there is 5e4d3b. T = this moment.
wait pixel 300 560 948a7b tol 40 within 240000
wait 5000
dump in-game-05s
wait 25000
dump in-game-30s
wait 30000
dump in-game-60s

# The camera starts on the player's town center, in the middle of the view:
# selecting it fills the panel at the bottom with its commands (T+68.8 s).
wait 8800
click 400 225
wait 2300
dump town-center-selected
move 745 188                  # where legion parked its pointer
wait 16000
dump in-game-90s
quit
